{"id":"n65876-1-11","stage":4,"title":"신바람 · 兴致","scene":"人物与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n65876-1-11-1","ko":"무슨 일인데 그렇게 신바람이 가득한 얼굴이야?","zh":"怎么了，脸上看起来这么兴奋啊？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"무슨","meaning":"什么","explanation":"무슨：什么","readings":[{"term":"무슨","audio":"/audio/41abb599007a8f8a3050.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66237","senseId":"2","lemma":"무슨","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"무슨","audio":"/audio/41abb599007a8f8a3050.mp3"}},{"text":"일인데","meaning":"事情","explanation":"일：事情；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；ㄴ데：先交代背景，再引出后文的转折、补充、请求或问题。","readings":[{"term":"일","audio":"/audio/dfc76879e2f5c3ead091.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"91895","senseId":"6","lemma":"일","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"일인데","audio":"/audio/3e8dafd1b93554a52226.mp3"}},{"text":"그렇게","meaning":"那样","explanation":"그렇다：那样；게：使前面的动作或状态修饰后文，也用于 -게 되다、-게 하다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"그렇다","audio":"/audio/f7c6efa694aaef9559bd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61178","senseId":"1","lemma":"그렇다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"그렇게","audio":"/audio/b470a873a66143d27846.mp3"}},{"text":"신바람이","meaning":"兴致，兴头，劲儿","explanation":"신바람：兴致，兴头，劲儿；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"신바람","audio":"/audio/d855cb8a8e1a8958aac9.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"65876","senseId":"1","lemma":"신바람","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"신바람이","audio":"/audio/6114c8e58fe3e099000f.mp3"}},{"text":"가득한","meaning":"满满，充满","explanation":"가득하다：满满，充满；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"가득하다","audio":"/audio/8a8f066d91aa18afc6b4.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62252","senseId":"4","lemma":"가득하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"가득한","audio":"/audio/413f22c798d79085ec74.mp3"}},{"text":"얼굴이야?","meaning":"脸色","explanation":"얼굴：脸色；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；야：非敬语判断或疑问句末，常与 이다 连用。","readings":[{"term":"얼굴","audio":"/audio/886ae927b512e2e4bc7b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17183","senseId":"3","lemma":"얼굴","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"얼굴이야","audio":"/audio/0fdde7dfcfe08156256d.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"41abb599007a8f8a","term":"무슨","zh":"什么","audio":"/audio/41abb599007a8f8a3050.mp3","entryId":"66237","definition":"虚指，表示不肯定的事物。","pronunciation":["무슨"]},{"id":"dfc76879e2f5c3ea","term":"일","zh":"事情","audio":"/audio/dfc76879e2f5c3ead091.mp3","entryId":"91895","definition":"所处的情形或状况。","pronunciation":["일ː"]},{"id":"f7c6efa694aaef95","term":"그렇다","zh":"那样","audio":"/audio/f7c6efa694aaef9559bd.mp3","entryId":"61178","definition":"表示状态、样子、性质等与此相同。","pronunciation":["그러타"]},{"id":"d855cb8a8e1a8958","term":"신바람","zh":"兴致，兴头，劲儿","audio":"/audio/d855cb8a8e1a8958aac9.mp3","entryId":"65876","definition":"非常兴奋愉悦的心情。","pronunciation":["신빠람"]},{"id":"8a8f066d91aa18af","term":"가득하다","zh":"满满，充满","audio":"/audio/8a8f066d91aa18afc6b4.mp3","entryId":"62252","definition":"某种感情或想法很强烈。","pronunciation":["가드카다"]},{"id":"886ae927b512e2e4","term":"얼굴","zh":"脸色","audio":"/audio/886ae927b512e2e4bc7b.mp3","entryId":"17183","definition":"某种心理状态表露于外的表情。","pronunciation":["얼굴"]}],"audio":"/audio/b06ea37d014144014444.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n65876-1-11-2","ko":"응, 어제 남자 친구한테 청혼을 받았거든.","zh":"嗯，昨天我男朋友向我求婚了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"응,","meaning":"是，行","explanation":"응：是，行","readings":[{"term":"응","audio":"/audio/107dd01c3d38a368ad44.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"30205","senseId":"2","lemma":"응","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"응","audio":"/audio/107dd01c3d38a368ad44.mp3"}},{"text":"어제","meaning":"昨天，昨日","explanation":"어제：昨天，昨日","readings":[{"term":"어제","audio":"/audio/79c5ada11647bce64407.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67075","senseId":"1","lemma":"어제","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"어제","audio":"/audio/79c5ada11647bce64407.mp3"}},{"text":"남자","meaning":"男性（남자 친구 合指“男朋友”）"